+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+On a 5,000-record store, the measured `SessionStart` hook cost at p50 was
+**11.9 ms** before `quick_check` was removed from the read path. After that
+change, the measured p50 was **1.05 ms**. The trigger-maintained `fts_rows`
+counter and the `record.body` length `CHECK` constraint were added in the same
+change.
